      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/winside_nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1987, the 90‑year‑old Theophilus Church was moved to Winside’s city park and converted into a museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
